# CS3790 Assignment 4

**Name:** Jehad M Hamad  
**Assignment:** CS3790 Assignment 4

## Description

Scheduler/dispatcher that will implement the Round-robin scheduling algorithm. There will be many jobs running at any given time so the dispatcher will time-slice the use of the processor acros

## Files

- `scheduler.cpp` - File that has my scheduler struct and function
- `period.cpp` - This program writes a char ('<char>') to stderr.
- `main.cpp` - Running the job loading and Scheduler/dispatcher
- `makefile` - Build configuration

## How to Run

## Usage

1. Compile the programs:

   make

2. Run the main

   bin/main.out

3. Input start and end ranges
   Give a starting char like A: `start`
   Give an ending char like E: `end`

4. Watch it go:
   

5. Full example

make

bin/main.out

Give a starting char like A: `start`
Give an ending char like E: `end`

